  "details": "I was able to directly connect to the Japanese server before the last network crash\n\nMy location is in Shandong, China, and the connection has been normal before. After these problems occurred, I asked my broadband operator for speed measurement and everything met the standards. They said it may be a problem with the server\n\nHave you changed the server operation？\n\nPreviously, the delay was within 300ms. Since the server crash, my delay has been displayed as 500-600ms in the game\n\nThis is undoubtedly fatal for players who have not purchased VPNs and game accelerators. Please check as soon as possible. Thank you",
